# Not written:
#   ping "echo" only: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   ping "echo" only-2: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   LAN to the package mirrors: host names as the destination: Cato takes them as destinations on the internet only
#   guest DNS, either port-2: its services cannot be written: source ports: a service of Cato has destination ports only
#   ICMPv6 echo: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   the partners reach the web servers of the LAN by HTTPS and nothing else: no IPv4 address as the source
#   drop everything else not coming from LAN: no IPv4 address as the source
